OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire falls silent for
OL,4,AArmistice Day services
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices have been held across
OL,7,FYorkshire as communities came together
OL,8,Fto mark Armistice Day.
OL,10,FA two-minute silence was held across
OL,11,Fthe UK at 11:00 GMT to commemorate the
OL,12,Fexact time an agreement to end the
OL,13,Ffighting of World War One as a prelude
OL,14,Fto peace negotiations began on 11
OL,15,FNovember 1918.
OL,17,FPeople paused at memorials, churches
OL,18,Fand civic ceremonies across Yorkshire
OL,19,Fto mark the 109th anniversary of the
OL,20,Fend of hostilities.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
