OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire falls silent for
OL,4,AArmistice Day services
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn North Yorkshire, council leader Carl
OL,7,FLes said commemorations were still
OL,8,Fhugely significant, adding: "With
OL,9,Fconflicts still very evident across the
OL,10,Fworld, it is as important today as ever
OL,11,Fto continue the tradition of
OL,12,Fcommemorating all those who have lost
OL,13,Ftheir lives in wars."
